# inc-67gh: frozen Warrior, cleared map, wizard-created (not SUMMONED) swarm.
# A caryatid column (Mov 0%, HD 8, regenerates) stays beside the swarm as a
# second enemy. DoProxAttack runs only when Turn%60==0 and a wait is 16 ticks,
# so 20 waits (320 ticks) give about 5 eligible turns.
@until "System Menu" ESC
ESC
w
@while "Enter wizard mode" y
@choose "Genocide Everything"
w
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Constructs"
@choose "caryatid column"
UP RIGHT ENTER
w
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Hominids"
@choose "plague of monkeys"
RIGHT ENTER
@dump:swarm-created
.
@while "more --" SPACE
.
@while "more --" SPACE
.
@while "more --" SPACE
.
@while "more --" SPACE
.
@while "more --" SPACE
.
@while "more --" SPACE
.
@while "more --" SPACE
.
@while "more --" SPACE
.
@while "more --" SPACE
.
@while "more --" SPACE
.
@while "more --" SPACE
.
@while "more --" SPACE
.
@while "more --" SPACE
.
@while "more --" SPACE
.
@while "more --" SPACE
.
@while "more --" SPACE
.
@while "more --" SPACE
.
@while "more --" SPACE
.
@while "more --" SPACE
.
@while "more --" SPACE
@dump:swarm-end
@quit
